WEBVTT

00:08:00.125 --> 00:08:02.752
And the wonderful thing about this

00:08:02.776 --> 00:08:06.450
is the first responders
who are involved in this team,

00:08:06.474 --> 00:08:09.624
they actually feel
like they can make a difference.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.860
Positive change where there wasn't any.

00:08:14.679 --> 00:08:15.837
This year --

00:08:15.861 --> 00:08:21.084
(Applause)

00:08:21.108 --> 00:08:27.283
This year, we opened a free-standing
specialty clinic, called PROACT,

00:08:27.307 --> 00:08:30.574
for those suffering
from substance use disorder.